#: compare.docbook:8
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Compare</title>"
msgstr "<title>तूल</title>"

#: compare.docbook:9
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&krusader; contains several compare functions: <guimenuitem>Compare by "
"Content</guimenuitem>, <guimenuitem>Compare Folders</guimenuitem> and the "
"<link linkend=\"synchronizer\">Synchronizer</link> compare function."
msgstr ""
"&amp;krusader; अनेकाः तुलनाकार्यं समाविष्टाः सन्ति:<guimenuitem> "
"सामग्रीद्वारा तुलनां कुरुत</guimenuitem> , ९.<guimenuitem> Folders इत्यस्य "
"तुलनां कुर्वन्तु</guimenuitem> तथा<link linkend=\"synchronizer\"> "
"समन्वयक</link> compare function."

#: compare.docbook:15
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compare by Content"
msgstr "सामग्रीद्वारा तुलनां कुरुत"

#: compare.docbook:17 compare.docbook:34
#. Tag: primary
#, no-c-format
msgid "<primary>Compare</primary>"
msgstr "<primary>तुलना</primary> इति"

#: compare.docbook:18
#. Tag: secondary
#, no-c-format
msgid "Content"
msgstr "विषयः"

#: compare.docbook:20
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select one file in each panel and use <menuchoice> <guimenu>File</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Compare by content...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice>. &krusader; "
"will open an external graphical difference tool that is <link "
"linkend=\"konfig-dependencies\">configured</link>. &kompare;, <ulink "
"url=\"https://www.kde.org/applications/development/kdiff3/\""
"><application>KDiff3</application></ulink> and <ulink "
"url=\"http://furius.ca/xxdiff/\"><application>xxdiff</application></ulink> "
"are supported."
msgstr ""
"प्रत्येकस्मिन् पटले एकां सञ्चिकां चित्वा उपयोगं "
"कुर्वन्तु<menuchoice><guimenu> संचिका</guimenu><guimenuitem> सामग्रीद्वारा "
"तुलनां कुर्वन्तु...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> . &amp;krusader; बाह्यं "
"चित्रात्मकं भेदसाधनं उद्घाटयिष्यति यत् अस्ति<link "
"linkend=\"konfig-dependencies\"> विन्यस्तम्</link> . &amp;कम्परे;, २.<ulink "
"url=\"https://www.kde.org/applications/development/kdiff3/\"><application> "
"KDiff3</application></ulink> तथा<ulink "
"url=\"http://furius.ca/xxdiff/\"><application> xxdiff</application></ulink> "
"समर्थिताः भवन्ति।"

#: compare.docbook:32
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "Compare Folders"
msgstr "Folders इत्यस्य तुलनां कुर्वन्तु"

#: compare.docbook:35
#. Tag: secondary
#, no-c-format
msgid "Folders"
msgstr "पुटम्"

#: compare.docbook:37
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Compare the files of each panel by using <menuchoice> "
"<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Compare Folders</guimenuitem> "
"</menuchoice>. By default newer and single files will be selected in each "
"panel, this behaviour can be changed in the <guimenuitem>Compare "
"Setup</guimenuitem> menu."
msgstr ""
"<menuchoice> <guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>पुटस्य तुलनां "
"कुर्वन्तु</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> इत्यस्य उपयोगेन प्रत्येकस्य पटलस्य "
"सञ्चिकानां तुलनां कुर्वन्तु । पूर्वनिर्धारितरूपेण प्रत्येकस्मिन् पटले "
"नूतनाः एकसञ्चिकाः च चयनिताः भविष्यन्ति, एषः व्यवहारः <guimenuitem>Compare "
"Setup</guimenuitem> मेन्यू मध्ये परिवर्तयितुं शक्यते ।"

#: compare.docbook:46
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "The files are not compared by content but by their names and dates only."
msgstr ""
"सञ्चिकानां तुलना सामग्रीद्वारा न अपितु केवलं तेषां नामभिः तिथिभिः च क्रियते "
"।"

#: compare.docbook:52
#. Tag: menuchoice
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenu>Edit</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Compare Setup</guimenuitem>"
msgstr "<guimenu>सम्पादनं</guimenu> <guimenuitem>सेटअपस्य तुलनां कुरुत</guimenuitem>"

#: compare.docbook:58
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configures the <guimenuitem>Compare Folders</guimenuitem> function."
msgstr "<guimenuitem>Compare Folders</guimenuitem> कार्यं विन्यस्यति ।"

#: compare.docbook:63
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guimenuitem>Select Newer and Single</guimenuitem> (default)"
msgstr "<guimenuitem>नवीनतरं एककं च चिनोतु</guimenuitem> (पूर्वनिर्धारितम्)"

#: compare.docbook:69
#. Tag: guimenuitem
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select Single"
msgstr "Single इति चिनोतु"

#: compare.docbook:74
#. Tag: guimenuitem
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select Newer"
msgstr "नवीनतरं चिनोतु"

#: compare.docbook:79
#. Tag: guimenuitem
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select Different and Single"
msgstr "भिन्नं एककं च चिनोतु"

#: compare.docbook:85
#. Tag: guimenuitem
#, no-c-format
msgid "Select Different"
msgstr "भिन्नं चिनोतु"
